# arvo-hash

L2 hash-domain types and algorithm contracts. `ContentHash` aliases
arvo `Bits<64, Hot>` for call-site domain naming. Generic streaming
`Hasher<const N: u16>` trait lets downstream code parameterise over
algorithm choice. Ships `XxHash3<const N: u16>` (default) and
`Fnv1a<const N: u16>` (FNV-1a-64 algorithm with `N <= 64` const-eval
guard) as concrete algorithms. One-shot ergonomics ride on
`ConstHash<N, S, Sign>` via Pattern C dispatch. `#![no_std]`, no alloc.
